  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, the conduit gains a bonus equal to 1/2 their conduit level to Knowledge checks to recall information about artifacts and magical items, and to Spellcraft and Use Magic Device checks.</p>\n<p>Additionally, the conduit can disable magic traps, and may use their Use Magic Device modifier in place of their Disable Device modifier when doing so.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/conduit#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
